const migrateRun=(raw:any,routines:Routine[],logs:Log[]):Run|null=>{if(!raw)return null;const plan={...raw.plan,context:raw.plan?.context??'general'} as Plan;const order=raw.order??routines.map(r=>r.id);const initial=raw.initialAllocations??initialAllocations(routines,logs,plan.context);return {...raw,plan,order,started:raw.started??{},done:raw.done??[],records:raw.records??[],preparationScheduledAt:raw.preparationScheduledAt??createPlan(plan,routines,logs,order,initial).start.toISOString(),initialAllocations:initial,allocations:raw.allocations??initial,reserveRemaining:raw.reserveRemaining??plan.reserve,reserveOriginal:raw.reserveOriginal??plan.reserve,rescheduleHistory:raw.rescheduleHistory??[],executionMode:raw.executionMode??'normal',emergencyUsed:raw.emergencyUsed??false,skippedIds:raw.skippedIds??[],activeRemainingOverride:raw.activeRemainingOverride??null,activeRemainingOverrideEnteredAt:raw.activeRemainingOverride!=null?(raw.activeRemainingOverrideEnteredAt??Date.now()):null}}
const dateTime=(d:Date)=>`${dateLocal(d)}T${String(d.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(d.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0')}`
const prettyDate=(d:Date)=>d.toLocaleDateString('ko-KR',{month:'long',day:'numeric',weekday:'long'})
const nudge=(elapsed:number,target:number,name:string,phase:'idle'|'active'|'done')=>{if(phase==='done')return '좋아요, 한 단계 마쳤어요. 다음 루틴도 내 속도에 맞춰 이어가요.';if(phase==='idle')return `${name}을(를) 시작하면 ${target}분 동안 ${name}에만 집중해 볼까요?`;const left=target*60-elapsed;if(left<=0)return `${Math.ceil(-left/60)}분 더 진행 중이에요. 마무리가 어렵다면 다음 일정도 함께 조정할게요.`;if(left<=300)return `이제 마무리 단계예요. ${name}을(를) 정리하고 다음으로 이동해요.`;if(elapsed>=target*30)return `${Math.ceil(left/60)}분 남았어요. 남은 과정에 집중해 보세요.`;return `${Math.ceil(left/60)}분 남았어요. 지금 하고 있는 단계에 천천히 집중해요.`}

